# Stage B (StackCube, 900 demos, 12000 updates) for every method. EWC lambda was chosen on seed 0 from {0.1, 1, 10} by the validation average of PushCube and StackCube success (0.1 won); its stage ends on validation resets, so f0_B_ewc_test re-evaluates it on the test resets
